  return `<div class="membership-panel-head"><h3>Ongoing care for you and the people close to you.</h3><p>Individual, couple and family pricing from Articella’s published Concierge Care page. Ask the practice how included visits apply to each member and how insurance may interact with the arrangement.</p></div><div class="membership-cards">${card('ONE PERSON','Essential · individual','$175 <small>/ month</small>','Annual payment published at $1,995.',['Up to six in-person visits per year','Annual wellness exam and EKG listed','Physician access by text, phone and video','Preventive plan and referral coordination'])}${card('TWO PEOPLE','Essential · couple','$325 <small>/ month</small>','Annual payment published at $3,700.',['Up to six in-person visits per year as described by Articella','Back-to-back appointment option','Annual wellness exam and screening listed','Ask how visit limits apply to each partner'])}${card('HOUSEHOLD','Family concierge','From $175 <small>/ month</small>','Primary member $175; partner $150; adult dependent $99 per month.',['Published as six in-person visits per member per year','Annual wellness exam and preventive planning','Family scheduling when available','Confirm household eligibility and final total'])}</div><div class="membership-inline-note"><strong>What the published plan guidelines also list</strong><span>$50 one-time registration fee for individual and couple plans, waived with annual payment; additional office visits may have a separate charge. The clinic should confirm all current terms.</span></div>`;
